WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
Begin in Warrior II with the front knee bent over the ankle.

2
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Turn the front palm up and float that arm overhead on an inhale.

3
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Slide the back hand down the rear leg as you arc the torso back and up.

4
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Keep the front knee bent and deep; gaze past the top hand. Switch sides.
